# Progressive difficulty

- Start from the simplest working case, then add one variable at a time.
- State prerequisites before a unit; never assume unintroduced concepts.
- Drills escalate: recall → apply → combine → debug → design.
- When a jump in difficulty is unavoidable, name the gap and bridge it.
